---
// Updated Description component with horizontal text rows and photo frames
---

<div class="min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center px-6 md:px-12">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto text-center">
        <div class="space-y-16">
            <!-- About Section Title -->
            <h2 class="text-6xl font-bold text-white font-poppins m-12">About Me</h2>
            
            <div class="space-y-6">
                <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto">
                    <p class="text-2xl text-gray-200 leading-relaxed text-center pb-5">
                        I'm Nathan, a Computer Science senior at the University of Illinois Chicago.
                        
                    </p>
                    <p class="text-2xl text-gray-200 leading-relaxed text-center pb-5">
                        I'm currently a Teaching Assistant for UIC's Data Structures course, where I love helping others grow their skills and passion for coding. 
                        I will also be serving as SparkHacks' 2026 Web Development Lead, leading the design and development of the hackathon's website.
                    </p>
                    <p class="text-2xl text-gray-200 leading-relaxed text-center pb-5">
                        I’ve also enjoyed participating in hackathons the past year, with my most recent achievement being a win at Northwestern's WildHacks 2025!
                    </p>
            </div>

            <!-- Photos -->
            <div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-8 md:gap-12">
                <div class="bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-md rounded-2xl p-6 border border-white/20 shadow-2xl hover:bg-white/15 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-2 hover:shadow-2xl hover:shadow-purple-500/20">
                        <div class="w-60 h-85 bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-md rounded-2xl border border-white/20 shadow-xl overflow-hidden">
                            <img src="sparkhacks2025.JPG" class="w-full h-full object-cover rounded-lg">
                        </div>
                    <p class="text-center text-gray-300 text-sm italic mt-2">Working for SparkHacks</p>
                </div>

                <div class="bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-md rounded-2xl p-6 border border-white/20 shadow-2xl hover:bg-white/15 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-2 hover:shadow-2xl hover:shadow-pink-500/20">
                    <div class="w-140 h-95 bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-md rounded-2xl border border-white/20 shadow-xl overflow-hidden">
                        <img src="wildhacks2025.jpg" class="w-full h-full object-cover rounded-lg">
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-center text-gray-300 text-sm italic mt-2">My hackathon win @ WildHacks 2025!</p>
                </div>

                <div class="bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-md rounded-2xl p-6 border border-white/20 shadow-2xl hover:bg-white/15 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-2 hover:shadow-2xl hover:shadow-blue-500/20">
                    <div class="w-60 h-85 bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-md rounded-2xl border border-white/20 shadow-xl overflow-hidden">
                        <img src="hackillinois2025.JPG" class="w-full h-full object-cover rounded-lg">
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-center text-gray-300 text-sm italic mt-2">Testing at 5AM during HackIllinois</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="space-y-6">
                <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto">
                    <p class="text-2xl text-gray-200 leading-relaxed text-center p-5">
                        I'm passionate about software engineering, AI, and full-stack/web development. 
                        I enjoy using technology to create meaningful impact, whether by building tools that improve lives, contributing to mission-driven teams, or learning more about AI and machine learning.
                    </p>
                    <p class="text-2xl text-gray-200 leading-relaxed text-center">
                        I’m always looking for opportunities, such as internships, research, or collaborative projects, where I can keep growing, building, and making positive impact through tech.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Skills Section -->
            <div class="mt-16">
